<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">{{service_name}}</view><view class="hero"><view>先把需求</view><view>交代清楚。</view></view><view class="sub">填写现有材料与目标，提交后确认服务范围和报价。</view><text class="link" bindtap="login">登录 / 连接设置</text><label>需求标题 *</label><input data-field="title" bindinput="input" value="{{form.title}}" maxlength="120"/><label>目标与材料说明 *</label><textarea data-field="description" bindinput="input" value="{{form.description}}" maxlength="5000"/><label wx:if="{{service_id!=='editing'}}">专业 *</label><input wx:if="{{service_id!=='editing'}}" data-field="discipline" bindinput="input" value="{{form.discipline}}"/><label wx:if="{{service_id==='graduation'}}">学历层次 *</label><input wx:if="{{service_id==='graduation'}}" data-field="level" bindinput="input" value="{{form.level}}"/><label wx:if="{{service_id==='editing'}}">源语言 → 目标语言 *</label><input wx:if="{{service_id==='editing'}}" data-field="language" bindinput="input" value="{{form.language}}"/><label>字数（选填）</label><input type="number" data-field="word_count" bindinput="input" value="{{form.word_count}}"/><label>期望日期（选填）</label><picker mode="date" data-field="deadline" bindchange="input">{{form.deadline||'选择日期'}}</picker><label>联系说明（选填）</label><input data-field="contact" bindinput="input" value="{{form.contact}}"/><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{consent}}"/>同意按所填信息处理本次需求，并确认材料由本人提供</label></checkbox-group><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交需求</button><view class="sub small line">附件可在提交后的详情页上传。提交结果待核对时，先进入“我的需求”核对，勿重复创建。</view></view>
